        <h2>Summary / Description</h2>
        <div class="description">
          The Inflight Refill Unit (IRU) is designed to provide a means of replenishing the water supply of the Research Animal Holding Facility (RAHF).  It interfaces, via quick disconnects, with both the  RAHF and the Shuttle main water system, its source of water.
        </div>

